          "items": [
            "Premier Vacation home in the Hub! We are one of the only 5 bedroom houses in Prominence capable of sleeping 20 people. Perfect for family reunions, boys/ girls trips, holiday get-togethers. 3 stories and over 3600 feet of memory-making on the famous 30A. Located between Seaside and Rosemary Beach with plenty of parking and access to Deer Lake beach and Seagrove Beach. Comes with passes to Beachside Villas private parking to enjoy beach sunsets. All amenities available.",
